[0.013, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[39;49m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[26d\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[J\u001b[H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m                                         Stuck in an Attic                                          \u001b[3;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\"Twenty-three dollars,\" he's saying. \"Twenty-three dollars for the best dream of your life.\"\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "You don't know his name or anything -- he's just the guy you always meet at parties thrown by people\u001b[6;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "you've never met. He's nobody's friend, exactly, but everyone knows who he is when it's time.\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "Probably doesn't even have a name, probably has bagged groceries at some godforsaken Shopper's Food\r\u001b[8d"]
[0.000, "o", "Warehouse since high school, but who cares? He's here to help you in your hour of need.\r\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"What do you say?\" he asks, holding up a repurposed cough syrup bottle with something green inside.\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "Green like candy almost never is.\r\u001b[13d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mStuck in an Attic\r\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mSure, you're used to piece-of-shit architecture (you live in Dundalk, for crissake), but this place\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "will be receiving some kind of award from you by the end of the night. There's totally unimportant\r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "crap strewn all over the place -- old sewing machines, an Easy-Bake oven, even a set of folding\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "chairs painted carnival blue -- but fortunately, almost all of it is in shadow thanks to an\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "underperforming fifty-watt bulb directly above.\r\u001b[20dIt's just you and the dude here. The only place in the entire house you could get any privacy. It's\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "only ten o'clock and already the call to hook up has come down from the heavens.\r\u001b[23dStairs lead downward, back to the party and that awful trance-bop they keep playing.\r\u001b[25d>"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
