[0.000, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mStairs lead downward, back to the party and that awful trance-bop they keep playing.\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[4;5H"]
[0.000, "o", "guy waggles the bottle a little in case your attention "]
[0.000, "o", "is wandering.\r\u001b[6d>"]
[0.000, "o", "examine bulb\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "Probably installed a hundred years ago. In this sense, it's a credit to Thomas Edison or General\r\u001b[8dElectric or whoever was in charge of light bulbs back then. It is otherwise pretty uninteresting,\r\u001b[9d"]
[0.000, "o", "even on the light bulb scale of interest.\u001b[K\r\u001b[10d\u001b[K\u001b[11d>inventory\u001b[K\r\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "You are carrying your wallet, your keys and a pager.\u001b[K\r\u001b[13d\u001b[K\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", ">down\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "Now technically speaking, you have a great deal of free will during this story, so you're allowed to\u001b[16;1Hcall it a night here and now"]
[0.000, "o", ".\u001b[K\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "You can go ahead and go downstairs if you want to -- surely there's something interesting going on\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "in this party. Maybe there's a pretty girl with long blonde hair you bump into and end up hooking up\u001b[20;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "with. You won't remember whether her name is Alice or Alicia, so you'll bail the next morning\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "without a word.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "It's okay. You won't see her ever again. And it all happens again the next weekend, and the weekend\r\u001b[24dafter that, too.\u001b[K\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[26dSo it's okay if you want to say no to the whole thing.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[28dThe guy waggles the bottle a little in case your at"]
[0.000, "o", "tention is wandering.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b[K"]
